    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/471ebe46f795ae8508c152a31d783fe4.poster.avif?t=1752870536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/471ebe46f795ae8508c152a31d783fe4.webm?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/471ebe46f795ae8508c152a31d783fe4.mp4?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face of Fear: The Forester</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being laid off from your old job, you started looking through available vacancies, where you come across one tempting job offer as a forester, you just need to go to the forest for a couple of months and perform simple duties, and they also promise to pay well. Forest, silence, nature, what could go wrong here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/cd77123afaff9b852a940789ae411e94.poster.avif?t=1752870536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/cd77123afaff9b852a940789ae411e94.webm?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/cd77123afaff9b852a940789ae411e94.mp4?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development, so not everything is shown. <u><strong>Add the game to your wishlist</strong></u> and subscribe so you don't miss updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/71d5945dd2d9c0067f78a1093a2ebe90.poster.avif?t=1752870536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/71d5945dd2d9c0067f78a1093a2ebe90.webm?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/71d5945dd2d9c0067f78a1093a2ebe90.mp4?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/471ebe46f795ae8508c152a31d783fe4.poster.avif?t=1752870536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/471ebe46f795ae8508c152a31d783fe4.webm?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/471ebe46f795ae8508c152a31d783fe4.mp4?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face of Fear: The Forester</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being laid off from your old job, you started looking through available vacancies, where you come across one tempting job offer as a forester, you just need to go to the forest for a couple of months and perform simple duties, and they also promise to pay well. Forest, silence, nature, what could go wrong here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/cd77123afaff9b852a940789ae411e94.poster.avif?t=1752870536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/cd77123afaff9b852a940789ae411e94.webm?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/cd77123afaff9b852a940789ae411e94.mp4?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development, so not everything is shown. <u><strong>Add the game to your wishlist</strong></u> and subscribe so you don't miss updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/71d5945dd2d9c0067f78a1093a2ebe90.poster.avif?t=1752870536\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/71d5945dd2d9c0067f78a1093a2ebe90.webm?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943960/extras/71d5945dd2d9c0067f78a1093a2ebe90.mp4?t=1752870536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
